4) The National Bank of the Republic of Haiti to be under the control of a Board
                    of Directors organized as follows: 


                            Haitian
                            American



                            The Minister of Finance;
                            An official to represent the holders
                                of the bonds of 1922;



                            An agriculturalist;
                            An economist;



                            A businessman;
                            A commercial banker.



                            A lawyer.
